        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0771, Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWeslock Transitional Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Square Rose is a grade 3 deadbolt suitable for residential use. It is made to be easy to instal with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit standard doors with a 2-1/8 inch Cross Bore, 1 inch Edge Bore that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Grade 3 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 3 Certified</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Pick Shield</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA recommended</a>, extra large interior thumbturn</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 25 mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 5 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</P>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Grade 3 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Zinc and All Metal Construction</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Weslock 5-Pin Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
